# Win32 Window Engine

## Coordinates
- Overlay and snap both use **`rcWork`** (via `MonitorManager`)
- Never mix `rcMonitor` for save with `rcWork` for snap

## Snap
1. Exit iconic / maximized / F11 fullscreen (`ExitFullscreenOrMaximized`) before resize
2. `SetWindowPos` with absolute screen coordinates (cross-monitor safe)
3. Electron hosts: gentle snap (`SWP_NOACTIVATE`), no HWND_TOPMOST, no style surgery
4. Verify placement; retry if wrong monitor or still fullscreen-sized

## Matching
- `IsMainApplicationWindow`: min 200×200 when visible; minimized windows still count for reuse
- `explorer.exe`: require title score ≥ 50 when multiple explorers open
- Electron: prefer largest window on score tie
- Multi-instance (Chrome): launch new rather than steal sibling
- Sticky `boxId → HWND` survives biome close

## Launch
- Store apps: `AppLauncher::LaunchPackagedAppForBox` (AUMID, never WindowsApps exe path)
- Obsidian: URI only via `AppLauncher::ResolveObsidianLaunchUri`
- `LaunchAndSnapApp` waits up to 20s; pump UI messages in wait loop
- Never snap an HWND in the exclude set

## Activate clean slate
- Use **`PrepareCleanSlate`** (tracked minimize), not Shell MinimizeAll, on biome open
- Create flow uses **`PrepareForOverlayCreate`** only
